me":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"2qAcKMt6-puXKlFi7T3mIg","review_id":"rbZNB_Y-5f2EJBRLGSV7lw","date":"2012-11-26T22:29:49","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9480204582214355,"text_excerpt":"Haydel's Bakery is MY favorite place to get King Cakes. They make a great product, plus, there is the bonus porcelain king cake baby trinket. I have to get one every year! This is the place I recommend if you want to send a king cake to someone in another state. They have a great Mardi Gras package with beads, coffee, an Arthur Hardy Mardi Gras Guide...the whole Mardi Gras experience in a box! They are also the place I entrusted to make my wedding cake, and they DID NOT disappoint! The cake was beautiful, created to our exact specifications, and was so delicious that several of our guests claimed it was the BEST wedding cake they had even eaten!!"},{"business_id":"2qAcKMt6-puXKlFi7T3mIg","review_id":"_AszvXuNIgtaHzDPyvR_QQ","date":"2018-02-18T23:10:40","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9477056264877319,"text_excerpt":"We order a King Cake from Haydel's almost every year so we can celebrate Mardi Gras in Atlanta. This year, we were in New Orleans for Mardi Gras and were able to visit Haydel's in person. We stopped in on a Saturday morning the weekend of Mardi Gras. They were packed but we were in and out without much of a wait. A lot of people were picking up King Cakes but we had stopped in to grab a few other sweets. We selected a cherry turnover, a couple of petit fours, and a mini cannoli. Everything was delicious. Haydel's offers a large variety of cakes and sweets. I would definitely recommend stopping it or ordering something online if you aren't local to New Orleans. We generally order the \"suga..."},{"business_id":"2qAcKMt6-puXKlFi7T3mIg","review_id":"COshzSWmf21sVDTlFP8AXw","date":"2020-05-16T15:35:50","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.945286750793457,"text_excerpt":"Haydel's is my King Cake go-to every year. I always hit up their website and order at the end of December and receive my King Cake on the first \"legal\" day to do so in January. They have great packages they send out with the cake, the history of Mardi Gras, some beads, and you can also order it with all kinds of stuff depending on the year -- their specialty beads, a CD, and other Mardi Gras supplies. They basically send your party directly to your door. This year, I also had the pleasure of going to Haydel's and actually enjoy their in-person location. They have some cute items around the store to buy/peruse as you're waiting in line. I picked up another King Cake, some tchotchkes, and t..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"2qAcKMt6-puXKlFi7T3mIg","photo_id":"nW-c66rkSmh_1ivFtomSzA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/nW-c66rkSmh_1ivFtomSzA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8780102729797363},{"business_id":"2qAcKMt6-puXKlFi7T3mIg","photo_id":"afezo_Rqm4ZGGw9MyNfrMw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/afezo_Rqm4ZGGw9MyNfrMw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8719857335090637},{"business_id":"2qAcKMt6-puXKlFi7T3mIg","photo_id":"W4aEe0wpLW2bUH3_kV9tuQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/W4aEe0wpLW2bUH3_kV9tuQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8704608678817749},{"business_id":"2qAcKMt6-puXKlFi7T3mIg","photo_id":"DiLWsZRHn02zghS4UaIXdQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/DiLWsZRHn02zghS4UaIXdQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8258140087127686},{"business_id":"2qAcKMt6-puXKlFi7T3mIg","photo_id":"CBHSlQOPK1aRAptCznSrtA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/CBHSlQOPK1aRAptCznSrtA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7522364258766174}]},"notebook_case":null}
